# Translate contract (do not flip)

Default / Go / Follow / paste / type / lang change = **Opus-MT** (Candle Marian, CPU, `%APPDATA%\lingua\mt`, or Pulse’s cache). Send `llm: true` (or the same seq2seq path). Status like `opus · opus-mt-es-en`.

Do **not** start Ollama for Translate. Do **not** fall back to Ollama. Do **not** reintroduce `scheduleLlm`, `overlayLlm`, `llmTimer`, or status `lex · llm…`. Chat may still talk to Ollama; Translate must not.

Lexicon (`llm: false`) is **fallback only** when Opus files are missing or the download failed (keep dest, plain error, `lex fallback`). Do not make lex what Randy sees on Go.

Follow: do not fire Opus every 700ms when OCR text is unchanged. Reuse last dest. First tick may download (`getting es-en…` is OK).

Do not change this contract unless Randy says so in chat.

```typescript
// BAD — lex as the default dest
setMtStatus("lex", "ok");
invoke("translate_text", { llm: false });

// BAD — Ollama overlay after lex
setMtStatus("lex · llm…", "busy");
scheduleLlm(source, from, to, epoch, 350);

// GOOD — default is in-process Opus-MT
setMtStatus("opus · opus-mt-es-en", "ok");
invoke("translate_text", { llm: true });
```
